# The Payload Control page, tabPayload: the gimbal's Tilt, Pan and Roll bars where the .resx puts
# them, and Reset Position.
#
# A press on a bar beside its thumb moves it one LargeChange, 10, toward the press - Tilt stands up,
# its maximum at the top - and each move sends all three angles as MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL in the
# MAVLink-targeting mode, not waited for. Reset Position puts the bars at zero, sets the mount to
# MAVLink targeting with no stabilisation (DO_MOUNT_CONFIGURE), and sends the zeros. Video Control
# pops the gimbal's video out. SITL has no mount; the commands go all the same.
# `GCSViews/FlightData.cs:1473-1480, 2959-2963, GCSViews/FlightData.Designer.cs:2088-2191,
# ExtLibs/ArduPilot/Mavlink/MAVLinkInterface.cs:4561-4594`
#
# Needs SITL (a copter): tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/fly-gimbal.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

screen fly
window 1600x1200
budget 14

# The vehicle first: a click before its first heartbeat is a click the screen may forget
# (vehicle.connected only says the link is open).
expect vehicle.count > 0
click fly-tabs-right
click fly-tabs-right
click fly-tabs-right
click fly-tabs-right
click fly-tabs-right
click fly-tabs-right
click fly-tabs-right
click fly-tabs-right
click fly-tabs-right
click fly-tabs-right
click fly-tabs-right
expect fly.tabs.first 11
click fly-tab-payload
expect fly.tab tabPayload
expect fly.page.overflow 0

expect fly.gimbal.pitch 0
expect fly.gimbal.yaw 0
expect fly.gimbal.roll 0
expect fly.gimbal.campoint ~ ;

click fly-gimbal-pitch@0.5x0.1
expect fly.gimbal.pitch 10
expect fly.sent COMMAND_LONG MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL 10,0,0,0,0,0,2

click fly-gimbal-yaw@0.95x0.5
expect fly.gimbal.yaw 10
expect fly.sent COMMAND_LONG MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL 10,0,10,0,0,0,2

click fly-gimbal-roll@0.05x0.5
expect fly.gimbal.roll -10
expect fly.sent COMMAND_LONG MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL 10,-10,10,0,0,0,2

click fly-gimbal-pitch@0.5x0.1
expect fly.gimbal.pitch 20
expect fly.sent COMMAND_LONG MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL 20,-10,10,0,0,0,2

click fly-gimbal-reset
expect fly.gimbal.pitch 0
expect fly.gimbal.yaw 0
expect fly.gimbal.roll 0
expect fly.sent COMMAND_LONG MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONFIGURE 2,0,0,0,0,0,0; COMMAND_LONG MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL 0,0,0,0,0,0,2

# Video Control is the map menu's Gimbal Video Pop Out (fly-gimbal-video.gui has the rest); its
# window's close box closes the control with it.
click fly-gimbal-video
expect fly.gimbal.video popout
click fly-gimbal-popout-close
expect fly.gimbal.video hidden
